next victim?\n\nBuilt for True VR Immersion\nHeadless Escape VR is a heart-pounding survival experience rebuilt from the ground up for Meta Horizon. Feel the terror as if you were truly there.\n\nPhysical Interaction: Use your hands to physically open creaky doors, rummage through drawers for clues, and solve intricate puzzles.\n\nTrue Stealth System: When the entity is near, hiding is your only hope. Duck into closets, hold your breath, and stay silent to survive.\n\n3D Spatial Audio: High-fidelity spatial sound ensures you hear every footstep and distant whisper, letting you know exactly where the danger is coming from.\n\nKey Features:\n\nTerrifying Atmosphere: High-quality lighting and textures create a hauntingly realistic environment.\n\nChallenging Puzzles: Finding the exit requires more than just running you must solve the mysteries of the house.\n\nOptimized VR Performance: Smooth frame rates and refined movement systems to minimize motion sickness.\n\nAre you ready to face your fears? Download Headless Escape VR now.", "short_description": "Can you survive the night, or will you lose your head?\n\nEnter a heart-pounding VR horror experience where every shadow hides a scream. Trapped in a decaying mansion with a headless entity on your trail, you must solve chilling puzzles and find a way out before it's too late.\n\nKey Features:\n\nImmersive Horror: Designed specifically for VR with terrifying 3D audio and visuals.\n\nPhysics-Based Puzzles: Use your hands to interact, hide, and unlock secrets.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.termsfeed.com/live/60075b89-fb8e-45c5-9aa4-639b8cb94945", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Hawks Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/shayan-naseem-496115163", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "cont